OUTCOME CLASSIFIED
CHECK ClassAssertion(<http://example.org/el-realization#Manager> <http://example.org/el-realization#alice>) NOT_ENTAILED
CHECK ClassAssertion(<http://example.org/el-realization#Person> <http://example.org/el-realization#bob>) ENTAILED
SUBCLASS <http://example.org/el-realization#Employee> <http://example.org/el-realization#Person>
SUBCLASS <http://example.org/el-realization#Manager> <http://example.org/el-realization#Employee>
TYPE <http://example.org/el-realization#alice> <http://example.org/el-realization#Employee>
TYPE <http://example.org/el-realization#bob> <http://example.org/el-realization#Manager>
TYPE <http://example.org/el-realization#carol> <http://example.org/el-realization#Person>
